// T ML236 1159,1160,1161,1162,1163,1164,1165,1166,1167,1168,1169,1170 | The Muslim Lantern | dash: | cut:0
#host("The Muslim Lantern", ("So we would say, the first thing is this, the Madhab that is incumbent by necessity upon every Muslim is the Madhab of ﷺرسول الله (Messenger of God). Madhab in the Arabic language means that you direct yourself, l ذهب is that he directs himself, his opinion towards a specific direction That's what Madhab means When you say the Madhab of Ahmed, this is where he directed his opinion towards The Madhab of Shafi'i, that's where he directed his opinion towards When you say ashShafi'iya, then they are the people who took the principles of Imam (Leader) Shafi'i, and applied the same principles in deriving rulings Same with every other School of Thought Now, how many Madhahib are there? – Who can tell us?",))
