#host("The Muslim Lantern", ("No. I said that the overwhelming majority of scholars already have the evidence reaching them, While one person in this case, or one view, or one school of thought did not, in this particular matter, get the evidence. But the evidence was there.. If the overwhelming majority of scholars disagreed, they disagreed because the news reached them So if one individual somewhere in some place did not hear evidence for something, That does not mean that there was a latency of God's Guidance reaching the people That just means that that one individual did not hear that specific point regarding that specific issue Which is not the majority of the Muslims!",))
